22
00:02:48,880 --> 00:02:50,080
And I don't like it

23
00:02:50,080 --> 00:02:52,700
Even if we're able to clear the game first

24
00:02:52,700 --> 00:02:55,540
Well, that's the kind of thing that would weigh on me

25
00:02:55,540 --> 00:02:59,200
I have a proposition for you

26
00:02:59,200 --> 00:03:00,980
Choose right or left

27
00:03:00,980 --> 00:03:03,480
And I'll give you whichever card you pick

28
00:03:03,480 --> 00:03:04,840
