31
00:03:07,420 --> 00:03:11,000
Yes!

32
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:20,200
Levy on!

33
00:03:24,680 --> 00:03:26,320
Wait, damn it, no!

34
00:03:26,460 --> 00:03:27,540
Return on!

35
00:03:27,540 --> 00:03:28,660
Masadora

36
00:03:28,660 --> 00:03:34,420
Let's go after them!

37
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:35,340
Not yet!

38
00:03:35,600 --> 00:03:37,120
First, check the cards in your books

39
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:42,940
I lost one of the number 80s we were trying to monopolize

40
00:03:42,940 --> 00:03:44,820
And a number 65 as well

41
00:03:44,820 --> 00:03:46,880
Hey, what about you?

42
00:03:47,100 --> 00:03:49,500
I lost numbers 42 and 53

43
00:03:49,500 --> 00:03:52,020
And I lost 29 and 24!

44
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:53,480
This is bad!

45
00:03:53,480 --> 00:03:56,680
They got me for two of the 85s that we've been hoarding!

46
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:59,800
All the ones they took were specified slot guards

47
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:02,360
And they took both types we were monopolizing

48
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:04,200
Damn!

49
00:04:04,500 --> 00:04:06,300
They must have used risky dice

50
00:04:06,300 --> 00:04:10,660
We're not with them, I promise!

51
00:04:10,820 --> 00:04:11,380
He's right!

52
00:04:11,480 --> 00:04:13,200
