330
00:16:44,780 --> 00:16:47,140
Oh crap, bastard got me

331
00:16:47,140 --> 00:16:50,040
Same here, back when we were making a deal

332
00:16:50,040 --> 00:16:51,400
Me too

333
00:16:51,400 --> 00:16:54,480
Seems to me like a bunch of them might be victims

334
00:16:54,480 --> 00:16:55,500
Yeah

335
00:16:55,500 --> 00:16:58,280
Is there a way to disable it?

336
00:16:58,900 --> 00:16:59,840
Yup, sure is

337
00:16:59,840 --> 00:17:02,940
You have to touch Genthru and say, I caught the bomber

338
00:17:02,940 --> 00:17:05,620
Dummy, why'd you say that?

339
00:17:05,760 --> 00:17:08,000
We could have milked a lot more cards out of them

340
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:10,380
Because it would have just started another fight

341
00:17:10,380 --> 00:17:14,860
The bombs can't be armed until Genthru explains how his ability works to you

342
00:17:14,860 --> 00:17:18,260
That's why, as long as you stay away from him, you should be fine

343
00:17:18,260 --> 00:17:24,900
Did you boys know that there are two ways to cast your spells?

344
00:17:25,680 --> 00:17:26,460
I did

345
00:17:26,460 --> 00:17:30,480
A spell card is used up the moment you say the words and cast it

346
00:17:30,480 --> 00:17:34,120
But there is a way you can keep reusing it

347
00:17:34,120 --> 00:17:38,220
You know how a list of the players you've met appears?

348
00:17:38,220 --> 00:17:40,900
As soon as you put a Pete card into your binder

349
00:17:40,900 --> 00:17:42,260
Try this

350
00:17:42,260 --> 00:17:44,580
Remove the card without pressing enter

351
00:17:44,580 --> 00:17:47,560
You'll notice that the spell card isn't used up

352
00:17:47,560 --> 00:17:49,480
So you can keep reusing it

353
00:17:49,480 --> 00:17:51,820
I've never tried that, have you?

354
00:17:52,100 --> 00:17:52,400
Nope

355
00:17:52,400 --> 00:17:57,560
If you buy at the same trade shop over 50 times

356
00:17:57,560 --> 00:18:01,000
Then you can buy all B-rank specified slot cards there

357
00:18:01,000 --> 00:18:05,320
If you become a regular customer, they'll start bringing it up

358
00:18:05,320 --> 00:18:09,260
Do you have a duplicate X-Ray Goggle card?

359
00:18:09,580 --> 00:18:10,680
Beauty Magnet Emerald?

360
00:18:11,060 --> 00:18:12,200
Maybe Wonder Pond?

361
00:18:14,000 --> 00:18:15,160
So what do you think?

362
00:18:15,760 --> 00:18:17,420
That satisfy you too?

363
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:20,360
Cause I'll give you another card if it doesn't

364
00:18:20,360 --> 00:18:22,180
No, that's fine, thank you

365
00:18:22,180 --> 00:18:24,000
Guess I'm up next then

366
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:24,620
Huh?

367
00:18:25,680 --> 00:18:27,700
Garenu, very nice to meet you

368
00:18:27,700 --> 00:18:31,460
That was fantastic, everybody

369
00:18:31,460 --> 00:18:33,660
We learned lots from you guys, so thank you

370
00:18:33,660 --> 00:18:37,320
The question now is which card we should try to monopolize

371
00:18:37,320 --> 00:18:41,520
The number 75 we have is probably impossible

372
00:18:41,520 --> 00:18:44,260
Each team can only get one of them

373
00:18:44,260 --> 00:18:46,280
And the limit on that card is 20

374
00:18:46,280 --> 00:18:47,860
That's way too high

375
00:18:47,860 --> 00:18:50,200
You guys have a number 75?

376
00:18:50,660 --> 00:18:51,820
That's really impressive

377
00:18:51,820 --> 00:18:54,300
Now list on, number 75

378
00:18:54,300 --> 00:19:00,040
Five other teams each have one

379
00:19:00,040 --> 00:19:02,480
So a Monopoly is impossible

380
00:19:02,480 --> 00:19:04,120
And the other two?

381
00:19:04,560 --> 00:19:06,040
List on, number 9

382
00:19:06,040 --> 00:19:08,220
And list on, number 2

383
00:19:08,220 --> 00:19:09,680
No good

384
00:19:09,680 --> 00:19:12,440
There are three teams that already have a number 9

385
00:19:12,440 --> 00:19:15,220
But nobody has number 2, Strip of Beach yet

386
00:19:15,220 --> 00:19:17,780
It just might work

387
00:19:17,780 --> 00:19:19,880
Guidepost on, number 2

388
00:19:19,880 --> 00:19:22,480
I know where to find it

389
00:19:22,480 --> 00:19:23,640
Sofrabi

390
00:19:23,640 --> 00:19:25,180
I've been there

391
00:19:25,180 --> 00:19:26,580
I have an accompany card

392
00:19:26,580 --> 00:19:28,380
All right, then let's go

393
00:19:28,380 --> 00:19:29,420
Accompany on

394
00:19:29,420 --> 00:19:30,520
To Sofrabi

395
00:19:30,520 --> 00:19:38,180
So this is Sofrabi, huh?

396
00:19:38,600 --> 00:19:40,120
It's a pretty big city

397
00:19:40,120 --> 00:19:42,500
Let's head in and get info

398
00:19:42,500 --> 00:19:48,900
We'll start at the edge and work inward

399
00:19:48,900 --> 00:19:51,300
Some NPCs don't want to talk

400
00:19:51,300 --> 00:19:54,140
So that's why you've got to visit them multiple times

401
00:19:54,140 --> 00:19:54,740
Got it?

402
00:19:55,040 --> 00:19:55,540
Yeah!

403
00:19:56,180 --> 00:19:56,700
Hey!

404
00:19:56,840 --> 00:19:57,040
Huh?

405
00:19:57,580 --> 00:19:59,380
Seems they found someone with information

406
00:19:59,380 --> 00:20:00,560
Backfast?

407
00:20:03,340 --> 00:20:05,840
The pirates run this entire town

408
00:20:05,840 --> 00:20:07,320
Every last inch of it

409
00:20:07,320 --> 00:20:09,580
You see, there's this local legend

410
00:20:09,580 --> 00:20:12,660
About an underwater cave called Poseidon's Cavern

411
00:20:12,660 --> 00:20:14,600
That's supposed to be around here somewhere

412
00:20:14,600 --> 00:20:18,240
The Strip of Beach is the entrance to it

413
00:20:18,240 --> 00:20:20,380
Not too many years ago

414
00:20:20,380 --> 00:20:22,120
Fifteen pirates came to this town

415
00:20:22,120 --> 00:20:23,620
Because they'd heard about the legend

416
00:20:23,620 --> 00:20:25,640
And that this cave also contained

417
00:20:25,640 --> 00:20:27,940
