418
00:20:27,940 --> 00:20:32,080
Razor and his 14 devils

419
00:20:32,080 --> 00:20:35,480
The poor fishermen were all tortured and killed

420
00:20:35,480 --> 00:20:41,580
Then the pirates murdered anybody

421
00:20:41,580 --> 00:20:43,580
Who knew anything about the Strip of Beach

422
00:20:43,580 --> 00:20:47,880
If you can get rid of the pirates

423
00:20:47,880 --> 00:20:50,000
I promise I'll tell you everything I know

424
00:20:50,000 --> 00:20:54,560
When we visited this place a few months ago

425
00:20:54,560 --> 00:20:56,260
We couldn't find a single clue

426
00:20:56,260 --> 00:20:59,900
Well, some info isn't always available

427
00:20:59,900 --> 00:21:02,180
Maybe you can only get it this time of year?

428
00:21:03,980 --> 00:21:06,500
Facing down Razor and his 14 devils, huh?

429
00:21:07,000 --> 00:21:09,940
It's entirely possible that the event can only be triggered

430
00:21:09,940 --> 00:21:11,340
By the right number of players

431
00:21:11,340 --> 00:21:11,800
Huh?

432
00:21:12,280 --> 00:21:13,880
There are 15 pirates

433
00:21:13,880 --> 00:21:16,500
And it just so happens there are 15 of us

434
00:21:16,500 --> 00:21:17,960
So what are you saying?

435
00:21:18,080 --> 00:21:21,340
That the event won't start unless you have a party of 15 or more?

436
00:21:21,560 --> 00:21:22,680
But I don't get it

437
00:21:22,680 --> 00:21:24,960
How would an in-game character know about that?

438
00:21:25,520 --> 00:21:26,600
With a company

439
00:21:26,600 --> 00:21:31,000
Yes, 15 or more people must reach Sofrabi with a company

440
00:21:31,000 --> 00:21:34,480
I'm willing to bet that that is the trigger for this event

441
00:21:34,480 --> 00:21:36,900
Well, that's pretty brutal

442
00:21:36,900 --> 00:21:37,540
What is?

443
00:21:37,780 --> 00:21:38,380
Nothing

444
00:21:38,380 --> 00:21:42,740
Right, to the pirates' base

445
00:21:46,500 --> 00:22:00,520
Gohan and his friends encounter some unsavory-looking pirates

446
00:22:00,520 --> 00:22:02,200
Their mission is clear

447
00:22:02,200 --> 00:22:06,700
But will the 15 allies be able to obtain the strip of beach card?

448
00:22:06,700 --> 00:22:08,380
You don't think so

449
00:22:08,380 --> 00:22:08,700
We don't think so

450
00:22:09,140 --> 00:22:09,700
Thank you

451
00:22:09,700 --> 00:22:10,340
There's no voice

452
00:22:10,340 --> 00:22:10,640
Back now

453
00:22:11,280 --> 00:22:12,780
In the maiden

454
00:22:12,880 --> 00:22:14,260
I don't think so

455
00:22:14,260 --> 00:22:15,820
Do you

456
00:22:15,820 --> 00:22:16,460
It's not abouthmm

457
00:22:16,480 --> 00:22:17,660
Talking to theRadar

458
00:22:17,660 --> 00:22:18,120
English

459
00:22:18,120 --> 00:22:19,340
What are you saying?

460
00:22:19,340 --> 00:22:19,400
Lucy

461
00:22:19,400 --> 00:22:19,720
A

462
00:22:19,840 --> 00:22:20,600
Hey

463
00:22:20,600 --> 00:22:21,740
Let us

464
00:22:21,740 --> 00:22:23,040
Is

465
00:22:23,040 --> 00:22:24,440
ут

466
00:22:24,440 --> 00:22:26,700
Whenever

467
00:22:26,900 --> 00:22:27,300
Let hum

468
00:22:27,300 --> 00:22:27,900
Come

469
00:22:27,900 --> 00:22:29,820
Feed first

470
00:22:29,820 --> 00:22:31,160
ıy

471
00:22:31,160 --> 00:22:57,480
Until now...

